n failed).":"分數未提交（驗證失敗）。","Next page: {n}":"下一頁： {n}","Journey complete — Daily":"旅程完成 — 每日","Try the Daily Challenge":"試下每日挑戰","New practice grid":"新嘅實踐格","Back to modes":"返回模式","Display name":"顯示名稱","Graphics":"畫面","Theme":"主題","Accessibility":"無障礙","Color-vision-safe markers":"色覺安全標記","Left-handed layout":"左手佈局","Haptics (vibration)":"觸覺回饋（震動）","Replay tutorial":"重播教學","How to play":"玩法說明","Enter letters":"輸入字母","Type {a}–{z} with the keyboard, or tap a square and type. Letters shared between crossing words fill both.":"用鍵盤輸入 {a} – {z} ，或者撳一個正方形然後輸入。交叉字之間共用嘅字母可以填補兩者。","Move around":"周圍移動","{keys} move the selection. {next} jumps to the next clue. Tap a clue in the list to select its word.":"{keys} 移動選擇。 {next} 跳到下一條線索。㩒一下清單入面嘅線索就可以揀佢嘅字。","Direction":"方向","Tap the selected square again (or press {key}) to switch between Across and Down.":"再次撳一下所選方塊（或者撳 {key} ），喺橫跨同向下之間切換。","Fix mistakes":"修正錯誤","{key} clears a square. Locked letters (confirmed ✓ or revealed ◆) cannot be changed.":"{key} 清除一個正方形。鎖定咗嘅字母（確認咗 ✓ 或者顯示咗 ◆ ）係改唔到嘅。","{word} checks the current word, {grid} checks the grid (from the clue list, or via the action buttons). Correct letters lock with ✓; wrong ones are flagged ✗. Each check costs a few points.":"{word} 檢查當前字， {grid} 檢查格（從線索清單，或者透過動作按鈕）。用 ✓ 更正字母鎖；錯嘅會標記 ✗ 。每張支票都要幾分。","{key} reveals one letter (◆) at a small score cost. Checks and reveals never lock you out of finishing.":"{key} 以小嘅分數成本顯示一個字母（ ◆ ）。檢查同揭露永遠唔會阻止你完成。","{key} pauses. The clock stops while paused or while the tab is hidden.":"{key} 暫停。時鐘會喺暫停或者隱藏標籤嗰陣停止。","Winning":"勝出中","Fill every square correctly to complete the page. Score = letters + words + streaks + time bonus − assists.":"正確填寫每個方格以完成頁面。分數 = 字母 + 字 + 條紋 + 時間獎金 − 助攻。","Enter":"進入","Tab":"標籤","Delete":"刪除","Up arrow":"向上箭頭","Down arrow":"向下箭頭","Left arrow":"左邊箭頭","Right arrow":"右箭頭","{date} UTC":"{date} UTC","Daily — {date}":"每日 — {date}","Practice ({difficulty})":"練習（{difficulty}）","easy":"簡單","medium":"中等","hard":"困難","First Completion":"首次完成","Finish your first grid.":"完成你嘅第一個格。","Mechanic Mastery":"機制精通","Win a mastery page.":"贏一個掌握頁面。","On a Roll":"連勝","Complete 5 words in a row.":"連續完成 5 個字。","Hard Milestone":"硬里程碑","Win a multiplied (hard) round.":"贏一輪乘數（硬）。","Seasoned Traveler":"資深旅人","Win 10 rounds in total.":"總共贏 10 局。","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"解鎖成就：{name}","Fill every square of “{name}”.":"填充「 {name} 」嘅每個方格。","Time limit {time}.":"時間限制 {time}。","At most {n} flagged mistakes.":"最多 {n} 個標記錯誤。","Only {n} checks available.":"只有 {n} 檢查可用。","Local replay verification failed — score will not be submitted.":"本地重播驗證失敗 — 唔會提交譜。","That letter is locked — it was confirmed or revealed.":"嗰封信已經鎖定咗 — 佢已經確認或者透露咗。","That square is not part of the grid.":"嗰個正方形唔係格嘅一部分。","Only letters A–Z can be entered.":"只可以輸入字母 A – Z 。","Action already applied.":"行動已經應用。","Action arrived out of order.":"行動順序錯誤。","No checks left for this round.":"今輪冇支票剩。","That square is already empty.":"嗰個廣場已經係空嘅。","That letter is already correct.":"嗰封信已經係正確嘅。","Unknown action.":"未知操作。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","Unknown check scope.":"未知嘅檢查範圍。","No such word.":"冇呢個字。","Invalid action: {reason}":"無效操作：{reason}","Word complete: {number} {dir} (streak {streak})":"字完成： {number} {dir} （連字 {streak} ）","{n} wrong letters flagged.":"{n} 錯字母標記。","{n} wrong letter flagged.":"{n} 錯字母標記。","30 seconds left!":"仲有 30 秒！","30 seconds left.":"仲有 30 秒。","Row {r} column {c}":"第 {r} 行第 {c} 列","empty":"空白","letter {ch}":"字母 {ch}","confirmed":"已確認","revealed":"透露","wrong":"錯","starts clue {n}":"開始線索 {n}","Grid {rows} by {cols}. {correct} of {total} letters correct. {words} of {entries} words complete.":"{cols} 嘅網格 {rows} 。 {total} 字母嘅 {correct} 正確。 {entries} 字嘅 {words} 完整。","Nothing to reveal — the grid is complete.":"冇嘢要透露 — 個格已經完成。","Give up this round? It will count as a loss.":"放棄呢輪？噉樣會計做損失。","Lesson {n} of {total}: {text}":"{total} 嘅 {n} 課： {text}","Lesson complete!":"課程完成！","Welcome to your travel journal! Tap the highlighted square, then